\n\n・和え玉：拉麵公子據說也是相對早期把和え玉的文化帶進台灣的店家，即便到現在2026年，有提供和え玉的店家仍然是少數。這碗單吃、配著湯吃都讓人欲罷不能，大推！（廚房師傅們會觀察客人吃拉麵的進度，並自動開始準備和え玉，非常的I人友善）\n\n・叉燒飯：130的高單價換來的是十足的份量，炙燒的時間蠻長，因此香氣也很強。白飯粒粒分明不會過濕，並且叉燒肉、醬汁和白飯的比例也很適中，整體味道很優，小可惜是積在碗底的油還蠻多的，建議可以把一些蔥留到最後平衡口中的油感。\n\n隨著鳳華結束營業，未來在台北想吃碗好吃的煮干濃湯就會想來拉麵公子了。\n🙏ごちそうさまでした！",null,[0,126]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15841010331632340335/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvTVZNeFdrTlhiV2gzVkZWc2NsTXdSbGxSYmxZMlUyMTRibVZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15841010331632340335/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvTVZNeFdrTlhiV2gzVkZWc2NsTXdSbGxSYmxZMlUyMTRibVZGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15841010331632340335/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvTVZNeFdrTlhiV2gzVkZWc2NsTXdSbGxSYmxZMlUyMTRibVZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15841010331632340335/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvTVZNeFdrTlhiV2gzVkZWc2NsTXdSbGxSYmxZMlUyMTRibVZGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15841010331632340335/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvTVZNeFdrTlhiV2gzVkZWc2NsTXdSbGxSYmxZMlUyMTRibVZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15841010331632340335/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvTVZNeFdrTlhiV2gzVkZWc2NsTXdSbGxSYmxZMlUyMTRibVZGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,4150,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toMVMxWkNXbWh3VFVsclMwRllRblY2U214bmVFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1ca618e474bb30e1!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkh1S1ZCWmhwTUlrS0FYQnV6SmxneEE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toMVMxWkNXbWh3VFVsclMwRllRblY2U214bmVFRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toMVMxWkNXbWh3VFVsclMwRllRblY2U214bmVFRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2